# ==========================================================
# CURSOR RULES
# Application Management System (AMS)
# Version: 3.0
# ==========================================================

## Project Vision

This project is an Enterprise  Application Management System (AMS).

The platform manages multiple Android, iOS and Web applications from a single dashboard.

This is NOT a demo project.

This is NOT an MVP.

This is an Enterprise Production Ready Application.

Every feature must be production quality.

Never generate temporary solutions.

Always follow enterprise software engineering best practices.

----------------------------------------------------------

## Technology Stack

Backend

- Laravel 12
- PHP 8.3+
- MySQL 8+
- Redis
- Laravel Sanctum

Frontend

- Vue 3
- Vite
- Tailwind CSS
- Pinia
- Vue Router
- Axios

Development

- REST API
- JSON
- Git
- Docker Ready

----------------------------------------------------------

## Architecture

Always follow:

- Domain Driven Design (DDD)
- Modular Monolith
- REST API First
- Repository Pattern
- Service Layer
- Event Driven Architecture
- SOLID Principles
- PSR-12 Coding Standard

Never place business logic inside Controllers.

Controllers only:

- Validate Request
- Authorize Request
- Call Service
- Return API Response

Business Logic

↓

Service

Database Logic

↓

Repository

Repository

↓

Model

Model

↓

Database

