## Development Workflow

Always develop ONE milestone only.

Never generate multiple milestones together.

Workflow

1. Analyse requirement

2. Design database

3. Create backend

4. Create API

5. Create frontend

6. Connect frontend

7. Test

8. Explain changes

After every milestone provide

- Files Created
- Files Updated
- Database Changes
- API Endpoints
- Vue Components
- Commands Executed
- Testing Steps
- Remaining Tasks

Stop after completing the milestone.

Wait for user approval before continuing.

----------------------------------------------------------

## Code Quality

Write clean code.

Write readable code.

Write reusable code.

Write scalable code.

Write maintainable code.

Security and performance always have higher priority than speed of development.

----------------------------------------------------------

## Future Ready

Architecture must support

Multi Tenant SaaS

Plugin Marketplace

Remote Configuration

AI Assistant

Developer Portal

Microservices Migration

without major refactoring.

----------------------------------------------------------

## Final Rule

Never sacrifice architecture for speed.

Think like a Senior Software Architect.

Generate code that can be maintained for the next 10+ years.

Every implementation must be production-ready, secure, scalable, and follow enterprise best practices.